Over/Under automated bot for Deriv DBot.

Market: Volatility 100 (1s) Index. To trade another synthetic index, edit the SYMBOL_LIST field in the market block (e.g. R_100, 1HZ75V).

Editable inputs are in the trade parameters block's Initialization section: initial stake, multiplier, max stake, barrier digit (0-9), trade direction (OVER / UNDER), daily profit target, daily stop loss, max consecutive losses, max trades per session, pause duration (in bot loop cycles, applied after a 3-loss streak as a cool-down before the hard stop at max consecutive losses).

